      "message": "In the case of apexes, it is the canonical name of the apex on device (`/apex/\u003capex_name\u003e`). As a more concrete example, the following soong modules have the same api domain `com.android.foo`\n- aosp apex `com.android.foo`\n- google source apex `com.google.android.foo`\n- google prebuilt apex `prebuilt_com.google.android.foo`\n- google other prebuilt apex `prebuilt_com.google.android.foo.v2`\n\nThe genesis of this terminology is in go/android-build-api-domains",
